WEBVTT

00:00:05.261 --> 00:00:11.924
On your company's page, select Historical Data

00:00:11.924 --> 00:00:17.352
If an ad box covers the page, close it with the X in its corner

00:00:17.352 --> 00:00:22.775
Each row is one trading day, newest at the top

00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:29.338
Use the Close column (not Adj Close) and the Volume column

00:00:29.338 --> 00:00:34.389
Scroll down to the day of the report

00:00:34.389 --> 00:00:39.545
The reaction day has by far the largest Volume

00:00:39.545 --> 00:00:50.063
Copy the Close for the day before, the reaction day and five rows above it

00:00:50.063 --> 00:01:08.414
Open the S&P 500's history and copy its Close for the same three dates
